{"4208150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bootleg Alchemist", "steam_appid": 4208150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bootleg : the illegal manufacture, distribution, or sale of goods, especially alcohol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemist : a person who transforms or creates something through a seemingly magical process</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an exiled alchemist, once the Kings right hand man , now thrown down to the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >commoners. Regain your status in the kingdom of WestKey. Outwit the guards and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ward off the bandits on your path of redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/ddd791d6ce95532d8eaf22661b89e4f6.webp?t=1782463069\" width=149 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix a variety of ingredients to produce potions with different affects. Help </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >citizens by fulfilling their potion requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/e22050d3acdfd3c8e881a2b8a800f6b1.webp?t=1782463069\" width=137 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/2ef004bcc24ba4e6dfd049e75d325d6a.poster.avif?t=1782463069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/2ef004bcc24ba4e6dfd049e75d325d6a.webm?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/2ef004bcc24ba4e6dfd049e75d325d6a.mp4?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase products from farmers to produce your contraband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/2019c084a2d2402f7fe6768b7fca3c22.webp?t=1782463069\" width=211 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/f018d2e0caf4dbc944343b4b7089c91d.poster.avif?t=1782463069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/f018d2e0caf4dbc944343b4b7089c91d.webm?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/f018d2e0caf4dbc944343b4b7089c91d.mp4?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn contracts from taverns and deliver products under the cover of night. Avoiding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the town guardsmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/c73b7ccd60c7566e99594acec504b461.webp?t=1782463069\" width=177 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/74c088611f81cbb2c4f7fa481ab7195e.poster.avif?t=1782463069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/74c088611f81cbb2c4f7fa481ab7195e.webm?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/74c088611f81cbb2c4f7fa481ab7195e.mp4?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase equipment and unlock properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/1167694dfb21e3396f4f35510dd24605.webp?t=1782463069\" width=189 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/22dcf8dc98b5c688ac122312e3bad2bd.poster.avif?t=1782463069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/22dcf8dc98b5c688ac122312e3bad2bd.webm?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/22dcf8dc98b5c688ac122312e3bad2bd.mp4?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bandits will attempt to steal any unguarded product , Protect your product by crafting potions with levels of deterrent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/c0d7902b5a452210a54efb6474f8c9d1.webp?t=1782463069\" width=206 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wouldn't go out with one bootleg? Then Invite multiple with co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bootleg : the illegal manufacture, distribution, or sale of goods, especially alcohol</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemist : a person who transforms or creates something through a seemingly magical process</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an exiled alchemist, once the Kings right hand man , now thrown down to the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >commoners. Regain your status in the kingdom of WestKey. Outwit the guards and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ward off the bandits on your path of redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/ddd791d6ce95532d8eaf22661b89e4f6.webp?t=1782463069\" width=149 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix a variety of ingredients to produce potions with different affects. Help </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >citizens by fulfilling their potion requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/e22050d3acdfd3c8e881a2b8a800f6b1.webp?t=1782463069\" width=137 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/2ef004bcc24ba4e6dfd049e75d325d6a.poster.avif?t=1782463069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/2ef004bcc24ba4e6dfd049e75d325d6a.webm?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/2ef004bcc24ba4e6dfd049e75d325d6a.mp4?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase products from farmers to produce your contraband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/2019c084a2d2402f7fe6768b7fca3c22.webp?t=1782463069\" width=211 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/f018d2e0caf4dbc944343b4b7089c91d.poster.avif?t=1782463069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/f018d2e0caf4dbc944343b4b7089c91d.webm?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/f018d2e0caf4dbc944343b4b7089c91d.mp4?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn contracts from taverns and deliver products under the cover of night. Avoiding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the town guardsmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/c73b7ccd60c7566e99594acec504b461.webp?t=1782463069\" width=177 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/74c088611f81cbb2c4f7fa481ab7195e.poster.avif?t=1782463069\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/74c088611f81cbb2c4f7fa481ab7195e.webm?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4208150/extras/74c088611f81cbb2c4f7fa481ab7195e.mp4?t=1782463069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s